    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to crush medieval armies, reduce their defensive structures to rubble, and dominate sprawling battlefields, all with cutting-edge modern warfare technology at your fingertips?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad is a lethal machine, armed with today\u2019s weapons. Customize your squad\u2019s size and composition, determine who will join your deadly ranks, and choose which weapons they\u2019ll wield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in an intense arena shooter experience as you battle relentless waves of medieval enemies, enhancing your equipment as you fend off their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your current firepower ever seems insufficient, don\u2019t hesitate to call in artillery support or air strikes to obliterate entire armies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398070/extras/9fda5cc38b28e780fb7a095e38e1db1b.poster.avif?t=1738669323\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398070/extras/9fda5cc38b28e780fb7a095e38e1db1b.webm?t=1738669323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398070/extras/9fda5cc38b28e780fb7a095e38e1db1b.mp4?t=1738669323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 unique soldiers, each with their own special traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 powerful weapons at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items available for purchase with gold earned between attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power to manipulate the stats of enemies, your squad, and weapon types, depending on which items you acquire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 diverse enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable squad attributes.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to crush medieval armies, reduce their defensive structures to rubble, and dominate sprawling battlefields, all with cutting-edge modern warfare technology at your fingertips?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad is a lethal machine, armed with today\u2019s weapons. Customize your squad\u2019s size and composition, determine who will join your deadly ranks, and choose which weapons they\u2019ll wield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in an intense arena shooter experience as you battle relentless waves of medieval enemies, enhancing your equipment as you fend off their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your current firepower ever seems insufficient, don\u2019t hesitate to call in artillery support or air strikes to obliterate entire armies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398070/extras/9fda5cc38b28e780fb7a095e38e1db1b.poster.avif?t=1738669323\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398070/extras/9fda5cc38b28e780fb7a095e38e1db1b.webm?t=1738669323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398070/extras/9fda5cc38b28e780fb7a095e38e1db1b.mp4?t=1738669323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 unique soldiers, each with their own special traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 powerful weapons at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items available for purchase with gold earned between attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power to manipulate the stats of enemies, your squad, and weapon types, depending on which items you acquire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 diverse enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable squad attributes.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Boomcestors is a top-down arena shooter game with rogue-lite elements, where players command a squad of up to six soldiers, battling various enemies in the medieval era using modern weaponry, artillery, and air support.",
